{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber Sensation: Micro Life is a microgame collection with a touch of 2.5D RPG flair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">featuring the adorable and chaotic story of an indie team racing to meet their final deadline!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 100 Microgames</strong><br>Test your reflexes and wits across a wide variety of lightning-fast games. Can you survive the unpredictable twists and turns of the Microverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2d97c624ba37418de040054e31051944.poster.avif?t=1751273799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2d97c624ba37418de040054e31051944.webm?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2d97c624ba37418de040054e31051944.mp4?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hilarious Characters &amp; Stories</strong><br>Meet a colorful cast of characters in a frantic race against time to finish their work before the final deadline. Their antics, mishaps, and moments of brilliance bring humor and charm to the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/42bfcfb53a5fb9dd50115b7da1c68503.poster.avif?t=1751273799\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/42bfcfb53a5fb9dd50115b7da1c68503.webp?t=1751273799\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big /></picture></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong><br>No two seconds are the same! From solving puzzles to dodging obstacles, every microgame presents a fresh challenge that will keep you hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2f65d3471bf6ea9bc73fcaa98d033ac2.poster.avif?t=1751273799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2f65d3471bf6ea9bc73fcaa98d033ac2.webm?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/2f65d3471bf6ea9bc73fcaa98d033ac2.mp4?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A World of Stylish Workspaces</strong><br>Explore detailed environments like a high-tech lab and a comfy house, each oozing with personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Hand-Drawn 2D Art</strong><br>Every frame is carefully crafted with expressive, hand-drawn visuals that give the game a warm and distinctive charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/8073672b3a8ae06376737e7aac18fa5a.poster.avif?t=1751273799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/8073672b3a8ae06376737e7aac18fa5a.webm?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/8073672b3a8ae06376737e7aac18fa5a.mp4?t=1751273799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2728Characters:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Talia</strong><br>She is the leader of The Lightworks Team, and the scientist and technician, who can make cool (and somehow useless) devices. And while she's smart, she's usually forgetful about her tasks. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/Talia.png?t=1751273799\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny</strong><br>The assistant of the team. She's the most friendly in the group, and loves to plan out everything in advance... although she's a major workaholic.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/TIny.png?t=1751273799\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alpha</strong><br>Tiny's co-worker. She's usually the most serious, and doesn't show much on how she really feels. Even with her stern look, she's the one who carries her team.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/extras/Alpha.png?t=1751273799\" /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373980?t=1751273799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751273799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/9b897f817b222cd8a9e73b96e35d8b7e5728ee87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751273799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373980/9b897f817b222cd8a9e73b96e35d8b7e5728ee87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751273799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber Sensation: Micro Life is a microgame coll